  "reasoning": "The defendants sold and used a pseudo‑base station to transmit large numbers of fraudulent SMS messages impersonating banks. This constitutes illegal use of public telecommunication facilities, which under Chinese criminal law is punishable as “破坏公用电信设施罪”. The content of the messages was fraudulent and intended to deceive recipients, meeting the elements of fraud (诈骗罪), specifically fraud carried out via information networks. Therefore the appropriate charges are illegal use/damage of public telecom facilities and fraud.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]破坏公用电信设施;诈骗<eoa>"
}
